@startuml SD-09_ContentAdmin_ImportReferenceData
title SD-09 · Content Admin — import reference data

actor "Content Admin" as CA
participant "Staff app" as App
participant "Content lifecycle" as CL
participant "Result stream" as RS
database "Object storage" as OS
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Redis" as R
participant "Import" as IM
participant "Notification" as N
participant "O*NET, ESCO" as SRC

CA -> App : Upload O*NET, ESCO files
App -> RS : Open event stream
RS -> R : Subscribe to staff channel
App -> CL : Start import
CL -> OS : Store uploaded files
CL -> DB : Store import job
CL --> App : Import started
App --> CA : Show progress
CL -> R : Enqueue import job
R -> IM : Take import job
IM -> OS : Read uploaded files
OS --> IM : File contents
IM -> SRC : Look up source identifiers
SRC --> IM : Source records
IM -> IM : Match records to sources
IM -> DB : Store matched, unmatched records
IM -> R : Publish import result
R --> RS : Import event
RS --> App : Push import result

opt unmatched records
  App --> CA : Show unmatched records
  CA -> App : Fix or skip records
  App -> CL : Save record fixes
  CL -> DB : Apply record fixes
end

App --> CA : Show imported data
CA -> App : Adapt to Vietnamese practice
App -> CL : Save adapted data
CL -> DB : Store adapted data, log
CL -> R : Enqueue notification
R -> N : Take notification job
N -> N : Email domain experts
CL --> App : Import summary
App --> CA : Show import summary
@enduml
